  "description": "11/22 🌍 Good Climate News 🇹🇻 Australia will allow residents of Tuvalu to relocate there due to the fact that the Pacific Island nation is set to become uninhabitable due to climate change. 🤝 China and the United States have agreed to work together in order to triple their renewable energy capacity by 2030. 🌳 Canada has committed $1 billion to protect 30% of British Columbia’s lands and waters by 2030 through working directly with First Nations. 💨 The European Union has agreed to reduce their methane emissions 30% by 2030 as part of the Global Methane Pledge that was introduced at COP26 in Glasgow. 🚊 Spain has proposed a ban on short domestic flights under 2.5 hours between cities that are connected with public transit in an effort to reduce emissions. Sources: ABC, BBC, Narwhal, Guardian, EuroNews #GoodClimateNews #ClimateChange #ClimateCrisis #ClimateAction #ClimateSolutions #ClimateOptimism",
